# Reown (WalletConnect) Cloud project id. Create a project at
# https://dashboard.reown.com and copy its Project ID here.
#
# Expo inlines EXPO_PUBLIC_*-prefixed vars into the bundle at build time, so a
# value change requires restarting Metro with a cleared cache: `npx expo start -c`.
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (gitignored) and fill in your own id; the WC
# relay will not connect without it. The id is a public client identifier (it
# ends up in any WC client bundle), but is kept out of this public repo to avoid
# quota abuse.
EXPO_PUBLIC_WC_PROJECT_ID=
